1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,000
3:00 AM. My smoke detector chirped.

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:06,500
Not an alarm. A number.

3
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:10,700
9... 8... 7...

4
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:15,000
Behind the plastic: a tiny control room.

5
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:18,700
One operator. Watching me.

6
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:23,000
He mouthed: don't open it.

7
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:26,700
3... 2...

8
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:28,700
The light went out.

9
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:29,800
1.
